        "original_id": "c15e9d31-29d1-5c1d-9b48-f7aecfd2a914",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: TVPlayer, Amazon Fire TV, Apple TV\n- Media Services: TVPlayer, YouTube, iTunes\n- TV Channels and Series: Home, Motorz TV\n- Networks and Platforms: Sky, Virgin Media, Youtoo America, Rev'n, Untamed Sports TV, Biz Television, Tuff TV, The Auto Channel, The Rural Channel, Roku\n- Concepts: live TV streaming, free-to-air channels, video games\n\nFacts:\n- TVPlayer is a live TV streaming service that lets users watch free-to-air channels on desktops, smartphones, tablets, Apple TV 4th Generation, and Amazon Fire TV.\n- Amazon Fire TV allows users to play video games with the included remote, through a mobile app, or with an optional game controller.\n- Home is broadcast 24 hours a day on Sky, Virgin Media, and TVPlayer.\n- Motorz TV is an American television series distributed nationwide on Youtoo America, Rev'n, Untamed Sports TV, Biz Television, Tuff TV, The Auto Channel, and The Rural Channel, and globally on YouTube, Amazon Fire TV, Roku, and iTunes.",
